  - _bookshop_name: building_blocks
    anchor_id: infrastructure
    title: Building Blocks Behind the Network
    intro: Digital commerce creates the greatest value when opportunity is
      accessible to every business. From neighbourhood kiranas to national
      brands, ONDC provides shared infrastructure that helps participants
      connect with customers, reduce costs and grow across an open network.
    cards:
      - name: DigiCatalog
        tagline: Create once. Sell across many channels.
        details: Build a single product catalogue for multiple commerce destinations
          with AI-powered infrastructure for discoverability, compliance,
          validation, and export readiness.
        image: /images/home-dpi-digicatalogue.jpg
        image_tag: Unified catalogue
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Gateway
        tagline: One connection. Thousands of opportunities.
        details: Access buyers, sellers, logistics providers, and service partners
          through a common network layer, helping businesses expand reach
          without managing multiple one-to-one integrations.
        image: /images/home-dpi-gateway.jpg
        image_tag: One connection, many partners
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Registry
        tagline: Find trusted partners faster
        details: A verified network directory that helps participants discover, trust,
          and connect with each other while reducing onboarding friction and
          improving interoperability.
        image: /images/home-dpi-registry.jpg
        image_tag: Verified network directory
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Discovery & Search
        tagline: Reach customers beyond your own storefront
        details: Help products and services get discovered across a growing network of
          buyer applications, increasing visibility without raising customer
          acquisition costs.
        image: /images/home-dpi-discovery.jpg
        image_tag: Beyond your own storefront
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Reconciliation & Payments
        tagline: Spend less time matching transactions
        details: Simplify settlements and payment tracking across multiple network
          participants to improve operational efficiency as businesses scale.
        image: /images/home-dpi-payments.jpg
        image_tag: Real-time settlement
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Dispute Resolution
        tagline: Trust backed by accountability
        details: Resolve issues faster through structured grievance and dispute
          frameworks that build confidence and transparency across every
          transaction.
        image: /images/home-dpi-disputes.jpg
        image_tag: Structured resolution
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Shared Commerce Services
        tagline: Enterprise-grade capabilities without enterprise costs
        details: Access common commerce services that reduce the need to build and
          maintain complex infrastructure. Helping businesses launch faster
          while lowering technology investments.
        image: /images/home-dpi-shared-services.jpg
        image_tag: Launch faster, together
        coming_soon: false
      - name: Verifiable Credentials
        tagline: Trust that is proven, not assumed.
        details: A two-layer trust system that gives every seller and network
          participant a verified identity, and makes credentials, government
          licences, business registrations, quality scores and reputation
          visible, verified and portable across the entire network.
        image: /images/home-dpi-verifiable-credentials.jpeg
        image_tag: Verified, portable trust
        coming_soon: true
      - name: Bharat Tourism Stack
        tagline: Verified Indian experiences, discoverable at last.
        details: 'Built with the Ministry of Tourism: a trust, verification, onboarding
          and transacting layer that verifies tourist and provider identity and
          surfaces credentials, licences and certifications at the point of
          booking — opening up supply that has stayed largely offline to date.'
        image: /images/home-dpi-tourism-stack.jpeg
        image_tag: Verified at the point of booking
        coming_soon: true
